sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Student
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant Api as DocumentController
  participant Service as DocumentService
  participant Access as EnrollmentAccessService
  participant Repo as SavedDocumentRepository

  Student->>Web: Save document
  Web->>Api: POST /api/v1/documents/{documentId}/save
  Api->>Service: saveDocument(studentId, documentId)
  Service->>Access: Require course access
  Service->>Repo: Upsert saved document
  Service-->>Api: SavedDocumentResponse
  Api-->>Web: 200 OK
  Web-->>Student: Update saved state
